Implement:
```python
def locator_channels(row):
    loc = row["exact_locator"]
    if "arxiv.org" in loc: return ["arxiv-page","arxiv"]
    if "crossref" in loc or "doi.org" in loc or re.search(r"10\.\d{4,}/", loc): return ["crossref"]
    if "inspirehep" in loc: return ["inspire"]
    if loc.strip().endswith(".pdf"): return ["locator","crossref"]
    return []
```
